      <Step>
      <strong>Read the elements</strong>
      <ul>
      <li><code>&lt;ditavalref href="…"&gt;</code> inside a <code>&lt;topicref&gt;</code> applies that DITAVAL to the topicref and everything under it. One <code>&lt;ditavalref&gt;</code> filters the branch in place; two or more make one copy of the branch per DITAVAL. Here the branch is the install task and, nested under it, <em>Recording your first track</em>, so each platform gets both pages.</li>
